Safari diagnostics: WebKit and Safari surface calls and exits.

Pages stay black and WebContent was launched three times with no crash line; the first 64
creates of a boot are long gone when Safari starts. WebKit/Safari creates and port lookups
are logged apart (128 lines), and their exits with status and exit reason.

